.TH ODYSSEUS 8 "October 2026" "ALI Linux 1.4.0" "System Daemons"
.SH NAME
odysseus \- first task up, last task down
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B odysseus
.RI ( started by systemd, not by hand )
.SH DESCRIPTION
Boot-mode enforcer, health watchdog, status feed
.RI ( /run/odysseus-status ),
update notifier, Sentinel memory (archives + restores firewall
blocks), Sentinel watchdog, and network navigator (traffic
accounting + gateway/DNS/internet lighthouse). Logs to
.IR /var/log/odysseus.log .
.SH FILES
.IR /usr/bin/odysseus ,
.IR /usr/lib/systemd/system/odysseus.service ,
.IR /var/lib/odysseus/last-shutdown
